  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Green Data Center, through U.S. Government - Trade and Development Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This desk study reviewed a preliminary concept proposal for a feasibility study and demonstration project to promote energy efficient data center development using advanced U.S. technology, as well as to develop national data center energy efficiency performance standards in China. The grantee for this project is the China Electronic Standardization Institute (CESI), which is a research entity under the Chinese Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT).</narrative>
  </description>
